      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Looks like this issue is mostly resolved, but the labels feel out of place.\n\nIt seems like placeholders like `muteChats` should probably be swapped out for translations. If that's not the plan, using camel case in a user-facing feature feels like an odd choice, especially if it's aimed at non-developers.\n\nI get that VRChat's site isn't localized yet, but I'd assume there's an I18n system in place, just defaulting to English for now, so localization is easier down the line.",
