  "details": "# Expectation\n\nI expected to see who I blocked and muted with options to unblock and unmute these people.\n\n# Reality\n\nI got an error page instead, as seen in the screenshot. \"Click Here To Reset\" doesn't fix this issue.\n\n# Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Ensure the VRChat build version is 1511.\n\n2. Go into a VRChat instance with other people.\n\n3. Mute someone's chatbox.\n\n4. Navigate to https://vrchat.com/home/playermoderations.\n\n# Technical details\n\n- Fedora Linux 38 (Workstation Edition)\n\n- Google Chrome 128.0.6613.137 (Official Build) (64-bit)\n\n- Revision fe621c5aa2d6b987e964fb1b5066833da5fb613d-refs/branch-heads/6613@{#1711}\n\n- Guest profile without extensions, custom settings, etc.",
